COMPILATION OF: E46L15

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program
S: Symbol Table List

  SYMBOLS:

BLOCK AT LINE 1, AUTO STORAGE 0 BYTES
a 0000 E46L15 ENTRY PARAMETERS(0) EXTERNAL CONSTANT
BLOCK AT LINE 6, AUTO STORAGE 4 BYTES
c 0000 OUTF FILE EXTERNAL STATIC
c 0000 Z FIXED DECIMAL(6,0) AUTOMATIC
   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46L15

   1 a 0000 E46L15:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2a] runtime 4: FIXED DECIMAL(6) with s = 0.  z = 123.5 rounds to 124 (R101's
   4 a 0006      measured rounding at s=0) and the 9-wide field right-justifies it, so the file must hold
   5 a 0006      six spaces then '124'. */
   6 c 0006   dcl outf file, z fixed dec(6);
   7 c 0006   z = 123;
   8 c 0016   open file(outf) stream output title('L15OUT DAT');
   9 c 0033   put file(outf) list(z);
  10 c 0054   close file(outf);
  11 c 005A   put list('DONE');
  12 c 0071   stop;
  13 a 0074 end E46L15;

CODE SIZE = 0074
DATA AREA = 0016
FREE SYMS = 386E
END  COMPILATION
